# Electron Forge (apps/desktop) refuses pnpm's default node_modules layout unless
# node-linker=hoisted or a custom hoist pattern is set. The desktop app bundles
# all of its code with Vite and packages no node_modules, so hoisting Electron's
# own packages is enough; the rest of the workspace keeps pnpm's strict layout.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*electron*
